he ultimate wave in your Jeep\u00ae Wrangler or Jeep\u00ae Renegade. A classic choose-your-own-adventure story, there\u2019s a different wave waiting for you just beyond each intersection.  \n \n- Stream or Download: Choose which method suits you and your internet connection. High resolution 4K or HD 360\u02da video available depending on your device compatibility.\n- Gaze-based interactive choices and multiple paths: Choose which surfer you want to ride with and which path you want to take by looking.\n- Jump straight in: No log-in or sign-up required. Start your adventure right away.\n\nJeep\u00ae Sessions: Surfing in 360\u200b\u00b0 \u200bis presented by World Surf League and Jeep. \n \nJeep is a registered trademark of FCA US LLC.", "short_description": "They say that every adventure begins with a choice. Yours starts here. In this interactive 360\u02da video experience, you decide how your surfing journey unfolds."}]}, "developer_name": "Rapid", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.worldsurfleague.com/pages/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.worldsurfleague.com/pages/privacy-policy", "publisher_name": "Jeep\u00ae and World Surf League", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.worldsurfleague.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "MOVIE", "NARRATIVE", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1314764609020557"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v